<title>GERMANY: Continental 9-mth profit rises 62 pct. [CORRECTED 09:16 GMT]</title>
<headline>Continental 9-mth profit rises 62 pct. [CORRECTED 09:16 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30:</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     125     up 62 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  7,630   vs 7,440</p>
<p>(Corrects Group sales figures from &quot;7.63 vs 7.44&quot; to &quot;7,630 vs 7,440&quot;)</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    46,382  vs 48,389</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Continental AG.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
